function mapCountryKey(n){const aliases={'United States':'United States of America','Korea, Rep.':'South Korea','Korea':'South Korea','Republic of Korea':'South Korea','UAE':'United Arab Emirates','Russian Federation':'Russia','Türkiye':'Turkey','Czech Republic':'Czechia'};return aliases[n]||n;}
function parseCsv(text){const rows=[];let row=[],cell='',quoted=false;for(let i=0;i<text.length;i++){const ch=text[i];if(quoted){if(ch==='"'&&text[i+1]==='"'){cell+='"';i++;}else if(ch==='"')quoted=false;else cell+=ch;}else if(ch==='"')quoted=true;else if(ch===','){row.push(cell);cell='';}else if(ch==='\n'){row.push(cell.replace(/\r$/,''));rows.push(row);row=[];cell='';}else cell+=ch;}if(cell.length||row.length){row.push(cell.replace(/\r$/,''));rows.push(row);}const headers=rows.shift()||[];return rows.filter(r=>r.some(Boolean)).map(r=>Object.fromEntries(headers.map((h,i)=>[h,r[i]||''])));}
function parseAdoption(rows){for(const row of rows){const keys=Object.keys(row),countryKey=keys.find(k=>/economy|country/i.test(k))||keys[0],q1key=keys.find(k=>/q1.*2026|2026.*q1/i.test(k)),q2key=keys.find(k=>/q2.*2026|2026.*q2/i.test(k)),changekey=keys.find(k=>/change/i.test(k));if(!q2key)continue;const name=mapCountryKey((row[countryKey]||'').trim()),q1=parseFloat(String(row[q1key]||'').replace('%','')),q2=parseFloat(String(row[q2key]||'').replace('%',''));let change=changekey?parseFloat(String(row[changekey]).replace('%','')):q2-q1;if(Number.isFinite(q2))adoptionRows[name]={q1,q2,change:Number.isFinite(change)?change:q2-q1};}for(const [n,v] of Object.entries(adoptionFallback))if(!adoptionRows[n])adoptionRows[n]={...v,change:+(v.q2-v.q1).toFixed(1)};}
function lawClass(name){const id=mapProfiles[name];if(!id)return '';if(id==='uae')return 'limited';if(id==='malaysia')return 'mixed';if(['singapore','saudi','egypt'].includes(id))return 'nonbinding';if(id==='kazakhstan')return 'unverified';if(id==='turkiye'||id==='peru'||id==='argentina')return 'draft';if(id==='eu')return 'binding';return 'binding';}
function countryTip(name,mode){const id=mapProfiles[name];if(mode==='law')return id?`${name}: ${jurisdictions[id].status}. Select to open profile.`:`${name}: no profile in this tracker.`;const v=adoptionRows[name];return v?`${name}: ${v.q2.toFixed(1)}% AI use in Q2 2026; ${v.change>=0?'+':''}${v.change.toFixed(1)} percentage points since Q1.`:`${name}: no value reported in the selected dataset.`;}
function makeLegend(mode,metric){if(mode==='law')return `<div class="atlas-legend"><span><i class="swatch binding"></i> Binding instrument</span><span><i class="swatch nonbinding"></i> Non-binding instrument</span><span><i class="swatch limited"></i> Limited, mixed, draft or local coverage</span><span><i class="swatch empty"></i> Not reviewed here</span></div>`;const title=metric==='q2'?'People using generative AI (%)':'Change since Q1 2026 (percentage points)';return `<div class="atlas-legend adoption-legend"><label>${title}</label><span class="gradient-key"></span><div><span>${metric==='q2'?'0%':'−2 pp'}</span><span>${metric==='q2'?'75%':' +8 pp'}</span></div></div>`;}
function makeMapCard(id,mode,metric){return `<article class="atlas-map-card"><div class="atlas-map-heading"><h3>${mode==='law'?'Legislation & regulation':'AI adoption'}</h3>${mode==='adoption'?`<div class="metric-switch" aria-label="Adoption measure"><button class="metric-button ${metric==='q2'?'active':''}" data-metric="q2">Current use</button><button class="metric-button ${metric==='change'?'active':''}" data-metric="change">Change since Q1</button></div>`:''}</div><div class="atlas-map-wrap"><svg id="${id}" class="atlas-map" viewBox="0 0 1000 550" role="img" aria-label="World map showing ${mode==='law'?'tracked AI provenance regulation':'generative AI adoption'}"></svg></div>${makeLegend(mode,metric)}</article>`;}
function makeCompareCard(){return `<article class="atlas-map-card compare-wipe-card"><div class="atlas-map-heading"><h3>Where policy and AI use overlap</h3><div class="metric-switch" aria-label="AI adoption measure"><button class="metric-button ${adoptionMetric==='q2'?'active':''}" data-metric="q2">Current use</button><button class="metric-button ${adoptionMetric==='change'?'active':''}" data-metric="change">Change since Q1</button></div></div><div class="compare-map-labels"><span>Legislation &amp; regulation</span><span>AI adoption</span></div><div class="atlas-map-wrap"><svg id="map-compare" class="atlas-map" viewBox="0 0 1000 550" role="img" aria-label="World map wipe comparison: legislation and regulation on the left, generative AI adoption on the right"></svg></div><div class="compare-controls"><button type="button" id="play-compare" class="compare-play">Play comparison</button><label class="sr-only" for="compare-wipe">Move the boundary between regulation and AI adoption</label><input id="compare-wipe" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="500" aria-valuetext="Equal split: regulation and AI adoption"></div><div class="atlas-legend compare-legend"><span><i class="swatch binding"></i> Binding</span><span><i class="swatch nonbinding"></i> Non-binding</span><span><i class="swatch limited"></i> Limited, mixed, draft</span><span class="adoption-key"><i class="gradient-key"></i> AI use: ${adoptionMetric==='q2'?'current (%)':'change (percentage points)'}</span></div></article>`;}
function renderAtlas(){
  const stage=document.getElementById('map-stage'),note=document.getElementById('map-view-note');
  document.querySelectorAll('.map-tab').forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.mapView===mapView);b.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(b.dataset.mapView===mapView));});
  if(mapView==='compare'){
    note.textContent='A moving split reveals the same countries in two datasets: legal coverage on the left and reported AI use on the right. Spatial overlap is descriptive and does not imply causation.';
    stage.innerHTML=makeCompareCard();
    drawComparisonWipe('map-compare',adoptionMetric,500);
  }else{
    const mode=mapView;
    note.textContent=mode==='law'?'Current instruments within this tracker’s scope. Select a shaded country or locator to open its profile.':'Population aged 15–64 using generative AI products. Choose current use or quarterly change; unshaded countries have no value in the source data.';
    stage.innerHTML=makeMapCard('map-single',mode,adoptionMetric);
    drawCountryMap('map-single',mode,adoptionMetric);
  }
  stage.querySelectorAll('[data-metric]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{adoptionMetric=b.dataset.metric;renderAtlas();}));
  if(mapView==='compare'){
    const slider=document.getElementById('compare-wipe'),play=document.getElementById('play-compare');
    slider.addEventListener('input',()=>{setComparisonWipe('map-compare',Number(slider.value));slider.setAttribute('aria-valuetext',`Regulation ${slider.value/10}% of map width; AI adoption on remainder`);});
    play.addEventListener('click',()=>animateComparisonWipe(slider,play));
  }
  const mode=mapView==='compare'?'compare':mapView,caveat=worldFeatures.length?'':' A simplified locator map stays available if detailed boundaries are blocked.';
  document.getElementById('map-source-note').innerHTML=mode==='law'?`Open a shaded country or locator to see legal scope and primary sources in its profile.${caveat}`:`Source: <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/corporate-responsibility/topics/ai-economy-institute/reports/global-ai-diffusion-report/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft AI Diffusion Report, Q2 2026</a> · <a href="${adoptionUrl}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">country dataset</a>. EU-wide aggregate is not reported; member states are shown individually where data are available.${caveat}`;
}
const SVG_NS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
function svgNode(tag,attrs={}){const node=document.createElementNS(SVG_NS,tag);for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(attrs))node.setAttribute(key,String(value));return node;}
function project(lon,lat){return [8+(lon+180)*984/360,8+(86-Math.max(-86,Math.min(86,lat)))*534/172];}
function ringPath(ring){return ring.map((p,i)=>{const [x,y]=project(p[0],p[1]);return `${i?'L':'M'}${x.toFixed(1)},${y.toFixed(1)}`}).join(' ')+' Z';}
function geometryPath(geometry){if(!geometry)return '';const polygons=geometry.type==='Polygon'?[geometry.coordinates]:geometry.coordinates;return polygons.flatMap(poly=>poly.map(ringPath)).join(' ');}
